<title>UK: ING leads 100 million mark Morocco-linked bond.</title>
<headline>ING leads 100 million mark Morocco-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SNAP LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM*  COUPON     11.50 PCT MATURITY  **29.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101	 PAY DATE ***07.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50 PCT  REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+600 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*BASED ON REPACKAGED MOROCCO NOTES</p>
<p>		**AVERAGE LIFE 6.7 YEARS</p>
<p>		***CALLABLE AT PAR ON 05.FEB.02</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.25 PCT  SELL CONC  1.25 PCT  PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING ARE MOROCCO LOANS TRANCHE A, MATURING 01.JAN.09.  NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON TO 29.JAN.97</p>
<p>		AMORTISING FROM 29.JAN.98.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
